msgstr ""
"Project-Id-Version: blur-my-shell v72 Polish completion\n"
"PO-Revision-Date: 2026-09-21 10:05+0200\n"
"Last-Translator: fedora-workstation-setup project\n"
"Language-Team: Polish\n"
"Language: pl\n"
"MIME-Version: 1.0\n"
